DESCRIPTION:This year's Drink at the Creek Concert Series will once again 
 bring you live music events in a gorgeous setting with a wide variety of p
 erformers taking the stage at Cedar Creek Winery\, Brew Co and Distillery\
 , just outside of Martinsville. Be sure to mark your calendar with the dat
 es below! As always\, this is an all ages music series and tickets are $15
  in advance per person for each show with a season ticket option available
 . $20 at the gate. Kids 12 and under are free! Coolers must be 12" x 15
LOCATION:Cedar Creek Winery\, 3820 Leonard Road\, Martinsville\, IN
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/drink-at-the-creek-concert%3
 a-hairbangers-ball-%26-the-big-80s/11383/
X-SOURCE:Visit Morgan County
