BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Movie at the MET: Young Frankenstein
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
UID:db716f70cb9a32e31e9c0ffee499b888@visitmorgancountyin.com
DESCRIPTION:Put… the candle… BACK!! Get ready for a hilarious night of
  mad science\, outrageous characters\, unforgettable one-liners and classi
 c Mel Brooks-style comedy! In this beloved 1974 Mel Brooks comedy masterpi
 ece\, you'll follow Dr. Frederick Frankenstein as he reluctantly inherits 
 his family's eerie estate and finds himself drawn into the delightfully ri
 diculous world of reanimating the dead! Movie begins at 7 pm on Saturday\,
  October 3\; doors open one hour before showtime.
LOCATION:Martinsville Entertainment Theatre\, 36 East Morgan Street\, Mart
 insville\, IN
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/movie-at-the-met%3a-young-fr
 ankenstein/11842/
X-SOURCE:Visit Morgan County
END:VEVENT
