DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
UID:0629765f1fbf6ba80d0decb3b3eadc0e@visitmorgancountyin.com
DESCRIPTION:Fables and Fairy Tales\, downtown Martinsville's independent b
 ook store\, is teaming up with The Glazed Gypsy around the corner to bring
  you a fun\, creative event where you can glaze your choice of three ceram
 ic pieces on Saturday\, October 3\, from 6:30 to 8:30 pm. The Glazed Gypsy
  will provide three fun options - a standard mug\, a mug shaped like a sta
 ck of books\, and a cactus o'lantern to get you ready for spooky season! P
 ricing is $35-55 depending on your choice. Enjoy a personalized shopping e
 x
LOCATION:Fables & Fairy Tales\, 38 N. Main Street\, Martinsville\, IN
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/books-%26-brushes/11882/
