BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Morgan County Fall Foliage Festival
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261008
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
UID:94150778849f0a3cb56a2ae865320c05@visitmorgancountyin.com
DESCRIPTION:This annual event is a Martinsville tradition - come join the 
 fun at this four day festival featuring fun events including carnival ride
 s\, vendor booths\, a 5K run/walk\, car show and so much more! The Fall Fo
 liage Festival normally takes place in downtown Martinsville\, but will mo
 ve to the Morgan County Fairgrounds in 2026 due to a downtown construction
  project. The festival parade is always Sunday\, beginning at 1 pm. A sche
 dule of major events by day is below. Schedule may be subject to change. 
LOCATION:Morgan County Fall Foliage Festival\, Main Street\, Martinsville\
 , IN
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/2026-morgan-county-fall-foli
 age-festival/11400/
X-SOURCE:Visit Morgan County
END:VEVENT
