BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nature Night: Tree Identification
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261007
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261008
UID:8172c270a802072fbe72154d2733841f@visitmorgancountyin.com
DESCRIPTION:Martinsville Parks and Recreation will host another Nature Nig
 ht at Jimmy Nash City Park\, on October7\, beginning at 6:30 pm. This mont
 hs topic is Tree Identification. Master Naturalist and Master Gardener Dav
 id Mow\, from the Morgan County Soil & Water Conservation District will be
  on hand to lead the group as you learn about native Indiana trees and how
  to identify them. Program will last approximately 1 hour. All ages welcom
 e! Free.
LOCATION:Jimmy Nash City Park\, 360 N. Home Avenue\, Martinsville\, IN
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/nature-night%3a-tree-identif
 ication/11899/
X-SOURCE:Visit Morgan County
END:VEVENT
